examples.solution_text:
On the unit circle, $x=\cos\theta$ and $y=\sin\theta$. Tangent is the gradient of $OP$.

$\begin{align*}\tan\theta &= \frac{y}{x} \\ &= \frac{\sin\theta}{\cos\theta}\end{align*}$

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=24mm,y=24mm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black}]
\definecolor{mathblue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\definecolor{mathred}{HTML}{EF6068}
\coordinate (O) at (0,0);
\coordinate (P) at (0.8,0.6);
\coordinate (F) at (0.8,0);
\draw[black,->] (-1.2,0)--(1.25,0);
\draw[black,->] (0,-1.2)--(0,1.25);
\draw[black] (O) circle (1);
\draw[black,thick] (O)--(P);
\draw[mathblue,thick] (O)--(F);
\draw[mathred,thick] (F)--(P);
\draw[black] (0.72,0)--(0.72,0.08)--(0.8,0.08);
\draw[black,->] (0.3,0) arc[start angle=0,end angle=36.8699,radius=0.3];
\fill[black] (P) circle (1.4pt);
\path (1.25,0) node[right] {$x$};
\path (0,1.25) node[above] {$y$};
\path (O) node[below left] {$O$};
\path (P) node[above right] {$P(x,y)$};
\path (0.41,0.13) node {$\theta$};
\path (0.4,-0.14) node[text=mathblue] {$x=\cos\theta$};
\path (0.87,0.3) node[right,text=mathred] {$y=\sin\theta$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

examples.question_text:
Each grid interval represents $0.2$ units. Read the signed rise and run from $O$ to $P$, then find the gradient of $OP$ and hence $\tan\theta$.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=25mm,y=25mm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black}]
\definecolor{mathblue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\definecolor{gridgrey}{HTML}{CCCCCC}
\draw[gridgrey,very thin,xstep=5mm,ystep=5mm] (-1,-1) grid (1,1);
\draw[black,->] (-1.2,0)--(1.25,0);
\draw[black,->] (0,-1.2)--(0,1.25);
\draw[black] (0,0) circle (1);
\coordinate (P) at (0.6,-0.8);
\draw[mathblue,thick] (0,0)--(P);
\draw[black,dashed] (0,0)--(0.6,0)--(P);
\fill[black] (P) circle (1.4pt);
\path (1.25,0) node[right] {$x$};
\path (0,1.25) node[above] {$y$};
\path (0,0) node[above left] {$O$};
\path (P) node[below right] {$P$};
\path (1,0) node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$1$};
\path (-1,0) node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$-1$};
\path (0,1) node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$1$};
\path (0,-1) node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$-1$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
